  "prefLabel": "Rev 501.02 Earth",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-03-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 501.02 \"Earth\" means “earth” as defined in RSA 155-E:1, I namely \"sand, gravel, rock, soil or construction aggregate produced by quarrying, crushing or any other mining activity or such other naturally-occurring unconsolidated materials that normally mask the bedrock.\" Earth does not include dimension stone as defined in RSA 155-E:1, IV.\n\nSource. #7381, eff 10-24-00; ss by #7860, eff 3-31-03, EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 501.01); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
